{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The source confirms the boundary issue: `apply.cljc` uses stream outcomes and owns a server step, while RPC currently assigns apply-qualified names to its own terminal reasons. I’m checking the callers and tests now so the ruling covers every migration site."}}
